{"id":"corto","lemma":"corto","pos":"adj","rank":1381,"glosses":["short (having a small distance from one end to another)","short (having little duration)","dim-witted, slow"],"ipa":"/ˈkoɾto/","forms":{"feminine":"corta","masculinePlural":"cortos","femininePlural":"cortas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-corto.wav","formAudio":{"corta":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-corta.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tiene el pelo corto.","en":"He has short hair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534491"},{"text":"La vida es corta.","en":"Life's short.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438310"},{"text":"Estamos cortos de dinero.","en":"We ran short of money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461036"},{"text":"Tengo las uñas demasiado cortas.","en":"My nails are too short.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637227"},{"text":"Escribe un ensayo corto.","en":"Write a short essay.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453404"}]}